@Begin
Metadata: Patient: Margaret, Age 74, Sex: Female, Diagnosis: Early-stage Alzheimer's disease

Dr. Chen: *CLI* Good morning, Margaret. How are you feeling today?

Margaret: *PAT* Um, good... (.) I mean, I think so...

Dr. Chen: *CLI* Okay, let's start with your family and friends. Who is the most important person in your life right now?

Margaret: *PAT* Oh, uh, my husband, John... he's still alive... (..) I don't know how much longer we have left together...

Dr. Chen: *CLI* I'm so sorry to hear that, Margaret. Can you tell me a little bit about your relationship with John?

Margaret: *PAT* Er, what was the question again? (.) Oh, right... our children... and grandkids... they're all grown up now... (.) I don't remember their names...

Dr. Chen: *CLI* It's okay, Margaret. We can try to figure them out together. Can you tell me about your hobbies or things you enjoy doing in your free time?

Margaret: *PAT* (Pauses) Um, I used to love gardening... and baking... but now... it's all just so... (.) fuzzy...

Dr. Chen: *CLI* That makes sense. It can be frustrating when memories are hard to come by. Can you tell me about a time when you felt happy or fulfilled recently?

Margaret: *PAT* Oh, uh, I think... (.) my birthday party last week... was it last week? (..) I had so many nice people there... and they all sang "Happy Birthday"... but what was the song called again?...

Dr. Chen: *CLI* It doesn't matter, Margaret. We're just glad you had a good time. Can you think of anyone who might be able to help us understand your condition better?

Margaret: *PAT* My friend, Karen... she's a doctor... (.) or is it an nurse? Er...

Dr. Chen: *CLI* It's okay, Margaret. We can look into that later. Let's focus on you for now. Can you tell me about any concerns you have about your condition?

Margaret: *PAT* (Pauses) Um, what was the question again?... Oh, right... my body... it's always tired... and I forget things...

Dr. Chen: *CLI* We'll work together to find ways to manage those symptoms, Margaret. You're not alone in this.

Margaret: *PAT* Thank you, Dr. Chen... (.) I feel a little better now...

Dr. Chen: *CLI* That's all for today, Margaret. We'll schedule another appointment for soon?

Margaret: *PAT* Uh-oh... what day was it again?...
